OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G1300FCraig Charles
OL,5,     GCraig looks back through the year
OL,6,     Gand shares some of his favourite
OL,7,     Gchats from 2025 with guests
OL,8,     Gsynonymous with the 90s:
OL,9,     Gfeaturing Sister Bliss, Nicky
OL,10,     GWire, and McAlmont & Butler.
OL,11,G1600FJamz Supernova's Teatime Session
OL,12,     GJamz covers during the weird week
OL,13,     Gbetween Christmas & New Year &
OL,14,     Ghas a Home Run at 5pm to add some
OL,15,     Gnormality to the week. Plus,
OL,16,     GEmily Pilbeam joins with ears on
OL,17,     Gan artist for 2026.
